<!--
  EIGHT REAL PAGES, not forty junk ones. A sitemap is a statement about what
  is worth reading; padding it with the app would say the opposite.

  Everything here is public and needs no account, which is the test for
  belonging in this file. The login page is deliberately absent: it is a form,
  it ranks for nothing, and somebody arriving there from a search has not
  found what they were looking for.

  lastmod is the honest date each page was last edited. If a page changes and
  this does not, the file is lying, and a sitemap that lies is worse than no
  sitemap. Worth a moment whenever one of these four is touched.

  (No double hyphens anywhere in these comments: XML forbids them inside a
  comment, and this file did not parse until they were taken out.)
-->
